<title>UK: INSIGHT - Gold seen lower in range, silver easier.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT - Gold seen lower in range, silver easier.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> SPOT     NY CLOSE  * SUPPORT * RESIST * RSI14 *   MA10 *   MA30</p>
<p> GOLD   348.30/8.70 *  347.00 * 354.00 *    45 * 349.34 * 351.82</p>
<p> SILVER   4.78/4.80 *    4.60 *   4.88 *    30 *   4.94 *   5.12</p>
<p> PLAT   365.50/6.50 *  350.00 * 367.50 *    43 * 367.88 * 376.78</p>
<p>-----------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - April 9---------------</p>
<p>Gold is likely to ease towards the lower end of its well-worn range of between $345 and $350 an ounce on Wednesday if prices breach initial support at $347, traders and chartists said.</p>
<p>Silver was likely to experience some downside pressure after faltering above $4.80 on Tuesday they added.</p>
